  "facts_of_case": "The parties were married in 2017. The wife filed a petition under Section 12(1)(c) of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955, seeking annulment of marriage due to concealment by the husband of his prior marriage and discrepancy in salary figures. The trial court allowed the petition and issued a decree for annulment.",
