    {
      "principle": "The consent of the respondent was obtained under a mistaken belief induced by misrepresentation, which can lead to annulment of the marriage.",
      "held": "The answer to this question depends not merely on the falsity of the statements, but on whether those particulars were so essential that the Respondent's consent was procured under a mistaken belief induced by them.",
